[52.271289, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI'll start by inspecting the Python environment, pip configuration, and the current working directory to reproduce the failure.\r\n\r\n```\r\npwd; ls -la; echo '--- python ---'; which -a python python3 pip pip3 2>&1; echo '--- versions ---'; python3 --version 2>&1; pip --version 2>&1; pip3 --version \r\n2>&1; echo '--- env ---'; env | sort | grep -Ei 'python|pip|virtual|path'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
