[76.137279, "o", "\r\u001b[2KPip is restored and imports correctly. Next I'll verify a real installation path: first inspect pip configuration/health, then install a small package from the \r\nindex (and a no-index wheel install) to confirm package installation works end-to-end.\r\n\r\n```\r\necho '--- pip config/debug ---'; /usr/local/bin/python3 -m pip config list -v 2>&1; /usr/local/bin/python3 -m pip debug --verbose 2>&1 | sed -n '1,35p'; echo \r\n'--- install from index ---'; rm -rf /tmp/pip-install-test; /usr/local/bin/python3 -m pip install --no-cache-dir --disable-pip-version-check --target \r\n/tmp/pip-install-test six 2>&1; echo '--- import target test ---'; PYTHONPATH=/tmp/pip-install-test /usr/local/bin/python3 -c 'import six; print(\"six\", \r\nsix.__version__, six.__file__)' 2>&1\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
